      "solution": "Common denominator $(x-1)(x+2)$: $\\frac{3(x+2)-2(x-1)}{(x-1)(x+2)} = \\frac{3x+6-2x+2}{(x-1)(x+2)} = \\frac{x+8}{(x-1)(x+2)}$"
