      "problem_text": "Simplify: $\\frac{\\frac{1}{x+1} - \\frac{1}{x-1}}{\\frac{1}{x+1} + \\frac{1}{x-1}}$",
      "answer": "$-\\frac{1}{x}$",
      "solution": "Numerator: $\\frac{(x-1)-(x+1)}{(x+1)(x-1)} = \\frac{-2}{(x+1)(x-1)}$. Denominator: $\\frac{(x-1)+(x+1)}{(x+1)(x-1)} = \\frac{2x}{(x+1)(x-1)}$. Divide: $\\frac{-2}{(x+1)(x-1)} \\times \\frac{(x+1)(x-1)}{2x} = -\\frac{1}{x}$"
    },
    {
