      "problem_text": "Solve: $\\frac{2x-1}{x+1} - \\frac{x-2}{x-1} = 1$",
      "answer": "$x = 2$",
      "solution": "Multiply by $(x+1)(x-1)$: $(2x-1)(x-1)-(x-2)(x+1)=(x+1)(x-1)$. Expand: $(2x^2-3x+1)-(x^2-x-2)=x^2-1$. Simplify: $x^2-2x+3=x^2-1$, $-2x=-4$, $x=2$"
